          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeoasi ambĩlĩlya kũsumbĩka mwaka wa mũonza wa kũsumbĩka kwa Yeu; na asumbĩka myaka mĩongo ĩna Yelusaleme: na syĩtwa ya inyia wake eetawa Nzivia wa ku Mbeeli‐sieva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeoasi eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũseo mĩthenya yake yonthe ĩla mũthembi Yeoiata wamũmanyĩisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ kũla kũndũ kũtũlu kũtyaavetwa; andũ nĩmaendeeaa na kũthemba na kũtoeesya ũvani kũla kĩndũ kũtũlu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
